    dcterms:conformsTo <http://example.org/standard/in-order-for-these-entities-to-be-the-focal-points-they-have-to-gather-analyse-and-exchange-information-on-firearms-their-essential-components-ammunition-and-blueprints-furthermore-they-should-ensure-the-collection-and-recording-of-all-information-regarding-seizures-of-firearms> ;
    dcterms:title "Information on firearms gathered by the National Firearms Focal Points"@en .

<http://example.org/dataset/registration-of-seized-firearms> a dcat:Dataset ;
